    \ 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1760986561731414200\n2025-10-21 02:56:01,744\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1760986561744818103\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 876**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** HDP‑RegCal + grad-clip=0.75 (optimizer sweep) — seed=42\n**ID:** 876\n**Tags:** regcal, optimization, gradient-clipping, hdprc, calibration\n**Abstract:** Minimal, compliant optimizer change: reduce global-norm gradient clipping from 1.0 to 0.75 on the HDP‑RegCal baseline. Hypothesis: tighter clipping further stabilizes CRI‑Off without harming PRS; all architecture and heads unchanged.\n**Score:** 0.691409996565435\n**APA_R2:** 0.8572\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0744\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9511\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5327\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5714\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8930\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9600\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, optax\nsys.path.append('storage/noema/submissions')\n\
    from dual_path_hybrid_motif_heads_regcal import build_network as build_network\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\nBATCH_SIZE = 64\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    # Keep baseline HDP‑RegCal hyperparameters (architecture unchanged)\n    return {\n        \"learning_rate\": 0.001,\n        \"hidden_dim\": 256,\n        \"kernel_size\": 7,\n        \"dropout_rate\": 0.10,\n        \"ds_dilations\": [1,2,4,8,16],\n        \"motif_k\": 5,\n        \"head_hidden\": 128,\n        \"head_dropout\": 0.05,\n        \"regcal_on\": True\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return build_network(hparams.get(\"d_output\", 1), hparams.get(\"task_type\", \"regression\"), hparams)\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    # Tighter global-norm clipping\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(0.75),\n        optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=0.01)\n    )\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    print(f\"[Complete] {trial_data.get('dataset')}\
    \ val_metric={trial_data.get('val_metric')}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network\
