    Best:0.8378 Time:1952s\n[Complete] v5g-dil APA val_metric=0.8378009796142578 seed=538\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.837801\nTraining time: 1966s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: c9ce03ce-82d3-4fa1-9c9b-d951e94ab5d6\nTotal time: 1969s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 22:56:06,615\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761576966615289811\n2025-10-27 22:56:06,629\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761576966629439883\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write noema/models/dsconv_pm_dil_attn.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `storage write noema/submissions/dsconv_pm_v6_dil_attn.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n\
