tick: 599
role: model
parts:
- text: "v6 improved overall to 0.6552, mainly via attention pooling lifting ncRNA and PRS. While v7 runs, I’ll test a minimal optimizer/attention tweak to recover APA/MRL without hurting classification: increase AdamW weight decay and momentum, and reduce attention width for parsimony.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"DSConv-PM v6r — Dilated + attention pooling with tuned AdamW (wd=0.012, b1=0.9,b2=0.999) and smaller attn\"\ntags: \"conv, dsconv, dilation, pooling, attention, optimizer-adamw\"\nabstract: \"Variant of v6: keep dilated DSConv + attention pooling + global reverse, but increase AdamW weight decay (0.012) and momentum (b1=0.9,b2=0.999) to stabilize regression (APA/MRL) and set attention hidden=128 for parsimony.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noema/models')\n  from dsconv_pm_dil_attn import create_network as base_create_network\n  from dsconv_pm_dil_attn import create_optimizer as base_create_optimizer\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42\n  BATCH_SIZE\
    \ = 64\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          \"learning_rate\": 1e-3,\n          \"hidden_dim\": 224,\n          \"kernel_size\": 9,\n          \"dropout_rate\": 0.10,\n          \"pos_dropout_rate\": 0.07,\n          \"head_hidden\": 128,\n          \"powermean_init\": 2.0,\n          \"residual_scale\": 0.5,\n          \"attn_hidden\": 128,           # smaller attention for parsimony\n          \"ds_dilations\": [1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 16],\n          \"enable_reverse_aug\": True,\n          \"eval_bireverse\": True,\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      h = dict(hparams)\n      h[\"num_blocks\"] = len(h.get(\"ds_dilations\", [1]))\n      return base_create_network(h)\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 1e-3):\n      # Stronger regularization and momentum for regression stability\n      import optax\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(0.75),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, b1=0.9, b2=0.999, weight_decay=0.012)\n\
    \      )\n\n  def complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n      ds = trial_data.get(\"dataset\")\n      val = trial_data.get(\"val_metric\")\n      seed = trial_data.get(\"seed\")\n      print(f\"[Complete] v6r-dil-attn {ds} val_metric={val} seed={seed}\")\n```"
